  "step_by_step_reasoning": "The whiteboard architecture depicts video streams ingested into AWS Kinesis Video Streams from four client inputs (Webcam Feed, Video Web App, IoT Devices, Mobile Apps). From Kinesis Video Streams, the video feeds into Rekognition Video for face and emotion detection. Detection data is emitted into a Kinesis Data Stream (raw stream), which triggers an AWS Lambda function for custom algorithm post-processing (calculating motion/velocities). Lambda outputs processed metrics into another Kinesis Data Stream (processed stream). Amazon API Gateway front-ends this stream to expose real-time analytics data to an external Visual Dashboard. All external actors and AWS services are mapped precisely according to the visual diagram and rules.",
